Day 62 - IAM Access Denied Investigation
Objective
Investigate an Access Denied error when accessing an S3 bucket.

Investigation
Reviewed IAM user permissions
Checked attached policies
Identified missing S3 permissions
Root Cause
The IAM user did not have the required permissions to access the S3 bucket.

Resolution
Attached the AmazonS3ReadOnlyAccess policy and verified access.

Key Takeaway
Access Denied errors are often caused by missing IAM permissions.
